claim.claim-text:
- a profile (1) according to any one of the preceding claims;
- a blind (T) having an end (T1) fixed to the at least one first longitudinal portion (10) of said profile (1) so that it remains a vacant end edge (B);
wherein the vacant end edge (B) is susceptible to cover the longitudinal channel (120) of the roller tube and/or a fastening bar and to cooperate with the outer surface (111) thereof to define a single substantially continuous circular surface without depressions, so as to avoid folds when winding/unwinding of the blind (T).
